second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What position does Atle Simonsen currently or formerly hold?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 13, \"text\": \"Atle Simonsen\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 15, \"end\": 119, \"text\": \"Atle Simonsen is a Norwegian politician who has held various positions in government and administration.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 120, \"end\": 223, \"text\": \"He is currently serving as the General Secretary of the Prefecture of Orne, a French official position.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 224, \"end\": 248, \"text\": \"Early Life and Education\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 250, \"end\": 311, \"text\": \"Atle Simonsen was born on February 12, 1965, in Oslo, Norway.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 312, \"end\": 412, \"text\": \"He studied political science at the University of Oslo, graduating with a Bachelor's degree in 1988.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 413, \"end\": 566, \"text\": \"He later pursued a Master's degree in public administration from the École nationale d'administration (ENA) in Paris, France, which he completed in 1992.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 567, \"end\": 573, \"text\": \"Career\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 575, \"end\": 721, \"text\": \"Simonsen began his career in politics in 1993, working as a policy advisor to the Norwegian Minister of Local Government and Regional Development.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 722, \"end\": 806, \"text\": \"He held this position until 1997, when he was appointed as the Deputy Mayor of Oslo.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 807, \"end\": 950, \"text\": \"During his tenure, he was instrumental in implementing several urban development projects, including the revitalization of the Oslo waterfront.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 951, \"end\": 1094, \"text\": \"In 2002, Simonsen moved to France, where he took up the position of Director of International Relations at the French Ministry of the Interior.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1095, \"end\": 1251, \"text\": \"He worked closely with the European Union and other international organizations to develop and implement policies related to border control and immigration.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1252, \"end\": 1295, \"text\": \"General Secretary of the Prefecture of Orne\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1297, \"end\": 1413, \"text\": \"In 2010, Simonsen was appointed as the General Secretary of the Prefecture of Orne, a position he still holds today.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1414, \"end\": 1616, \"text\": \"As General Secretary, he is responsible for overseeing the administrative and logistical operations of the prefecture, which includes managing a staff of over 500 employees and a budget of €150 million.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1617, \"end\": 1782, \"text\": \"Under his leadership, the Prefecture of Orne has implemented several initiatives aimed at promoting economic development and improving public services in the region.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1783, \"end\": 2000, \"text\": \"These initiatives have included the creation of a business incubator, the development of a regional transportation plan, and the implementation of a new system for delivering social services to vulnerable populations.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2001, \"end\": 2023, \"text\": \"Studies and References\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2025, \"end\": 2275, \"text\": \"A 2015 study published in the Journal of Public Administration found that Simonsen's leadership style was characterized by a strong emphasis on collaboration and communication, which contributed to the success of the Prefecture of Orne's initiatives.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2276, \"end\": 2279, \"text\": \"(1)\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2281, \"end\": 2565, \"text\": \"A 2018 report by the French Ministry of the Interior praised Simonsen's efforts to improve the efficiency and effectiveness of the prefecture's operations, noting that he had implemented several cost-saving measures without compromising the quality of services provided to the public.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 87, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Atle Simonsen Confirmed as Deputy Member of the Parliament of Norway**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 89, \"end\": 258, \"text\": \"Oslo, Norway - In a move that solidifies his position in Norwegian politics, Atle Simonsen has been officially recognized as a deputy member of the Parliament of Norway.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 259, \"end\": 481, \"text\": \"This esteemed role is reserved for individuals who meet in the parliament when the ordinary member is unavailable, and Simonsen's appointment is a testament to his dedication and commitment to serving the people of Norway.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 482, \"end\": 642, \"text\": \"According to the official records of the Parliament of Norway, Atle Simonsen's name appears on the list of deputy members, alongside other esteemed politicians.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 643, \"end\": 744, \"text\": \"This confirmation comes as no surprise to those familiar with Simonsen's work in the political arena.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 745, \"end\": 1003, \"text\": \"\\\"Atle Simonsen has been a vocal advocate for the people of Norway, and his appointment as a deputy member of the Parliament is a well-deserved recognition of his efforts,\\\" said Torbjørn Røe Isaksen, a fellow politician and member of the Parliament of Norway.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1004, \"end\": 1153, \"text\": \"\\\"His dedication to the country and its citizens is unwavering, and I have no doubt that he will continue to serve with distinction in this new role.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1154, \"end\": 1398, \"text\": \"Data from the Norwegian Parliament's website reveals that Simonsen has been actively involved in various parliamentary committees, including the Committee on Health and Care Services and the Committee on Education, Research, and Church Affairs.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1399, \"end\": 1548, \"text\": \"His participation in these committees demonstrates his commitment to addressing the pressing issues facing Norway's healthcare and education systems.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1549, \"end\": 1785, \"text\": \"Furthermore, Simonsen's appointment as a deputy member of the Parliament of Norway is in line with the country's parliamentary system, which allows for the temporary replacement of ordinary members in cases of absence or incapacitation.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1786, \"end\": 1932, \"text\": \"This ensures that the voices of Norwegian citizens are always represented in the parliament, even in the absence of their elected representatives.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1933, \"end\": 2169, \"text\": \"In a statement, Simonsen expressed his gratitude for the opportunity to serve in this new capacity, saying, \\\"I am honored to be entrusted with this responsibility and look forward to continuing my work on behalf of the people of Norway.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2170, \"end\": 2280, \"text\": \"I am committed to ensuring that their voices are heard and their interests are represented in the parliament.\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2281, \"end\": 2403, \"text\": \"With this confirmation, Atle Simonsen solidifies his position as a respected and influential figure in Norwegian politics.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2404, \"end\": 2563, \"text\": \"As a deputy member of the Parliament of Norway, he will continue to play a vital role in shaping the country's future and addressing the needs of its citizens.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c1\", \"entity\": \"Atle Simonsen\", \"scope\": \"former\", \"claim\": \"Atle Simonsen formerly held the position of Deputy Mayor of Oslo.\", \"answer\": \"Deputy Mayor of Oslo\", \"quote\": \"He held this position until 1997, when he was appointed as the Deputy Mayor of Oslo.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c2\", \"entity\": \"Atle Simonsen\", \"scope\": \"former\", \"claim\": \"Atle Simonsen formerly held the position of Director of International Relations at the French Ministry of the Interior.\", \"answer\": \"Director of International Relations at the French Ministry of the Interior\", \"quote\": \"In 2002, Simonsen moved to France, where he took up the position of Director of International Relations at the French Ministry of the Interior.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"General Secretary of the Prefecture of Orne\", \"Deputy Mayor of Oslo\", \"Director of International Relations at the French Ministry of the Interior\", \"deputy member of the Parliament of Norway\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"General Secretary of the Prefecture of Orne\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Deputy Mayor of Oslo\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Director of International Relations at the French Ministry of the Interior\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"deputy member of the Parliament of Norway\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
